<title>BELGIUM: BELGIAN IRIS GROUP IN 62.5 MLN BFR PLACEMENT.</title>
<headline>BELGIAN IRIS GROUP IN 62.5 MLN BFR PLACEMENT.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian Image Recognition Integrated Systems SA (Iris) raised 62.5 million Belgian francs through a capital increase, underwritten by KB Securities and Credit Generale, Iris said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>After privately placing the issue KB Securities and Credit Generale will continue to hold shares in Iris. Iris gave no details.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
